Hi people!  I was playing with the Mac version of NetHack (2.3).
I noticed that if I save a character and quit the program, but
later start up the program again without turning off the 
computer, the character will be intact.

But after saving a character, I shutdown my machine, then start
it some time later and try to use the character that I've
saved, all the objects and monsters(??) are unrecognizable.
I get descriptions of objects which look like the pointers  for
the description are pointing half way into descriptions of
other items. All messages printed on the top line also
appear this way.

So is there something wrong with the Mac version or is this
some kind of deterrant from saving a good character before
he gets killed (by some unfortunate accident :-) )

